RETAIL-DERIVED FACTS

A bounded class of retail-derived facts is carried in the source itself:
format and asset identifiers, enumeration names, and measured functional
constants — notably the per-surface response table generated into
VRC/Riding/Board/RideableBoard.Contract.Generated.cs and
Basis/Riding/BasisBoard.Contract.Generated.cs (Trailmap/specs/data/ride-v1.json is
the authoritative copy). These are the functional interface the ride
interoperates through, retained because a course cannot be ridden correctly
without them. They are unaccompanied by any retail code, asset, or executable,
and they are the only retail-derived content carried; everything else is
generated locally from your own copy of the game and stays out of version
control.

